      "title": "Meet Your Body! 👋",
      "text": "Your body is made of many outside parts! Legs help you walk and run. Hands help you hold a pencil, lift a lunch box, and wave to friends!",
      "emoji": "🏃",
      "bgColor": "from-pink-400 to-rose-500",
